    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="97156e43-34aa-5ca7-aa03-0015e1b559a8" activityNameId="3254c7dd-787d-5952-bc63-ee6ac75c0da5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">N-olefins, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: N-olefins, at plant
data based on the ECOSOL study of the European surfactant industry. Allocations in multioutput processes were made, using the relative mass outputs of products.;
UUID: 2c70330d-0456-3056-ae0c-a1b6869f22b1
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of n-olefins out of n-paraffins and ethylene. Water consumption and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: Data based on the European n-olefins production
Technology: Average technology, typical for European production conditions in the mid 90s
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: 500 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2c70330d-0456-3056-ae0c-a1b6869f22b1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
